  │ 
  │     apprafter target use prod
  │     apprafter backup create --repo <repo>
  │     apprafter destroy --yes
  │     apprafter restore <repo> --reprovision --server-type <sku>
  │ 
  │ (`target machine` only sets the type on a target that has NOT provisioned
